           change).
       So the whole cost of guarding the most-read surface in the repository was: write 95 doc comments, add
       one property. Nothing else had to be decided first, and both have now been paid.

       🔴 ONE THING N-2 MEASURED THAT NOBODY HAD, and it belongs here because it is what the property BUYS
