       directory, whole, from one -t:Rebuild of St4i.EdgeCore — and the grouping reproduced AL-1's
       forecast row for row, all sixteen. Four clusters were weighed: the built-in driver families
       (Drivers/* = 109), edge-local configuration (Config + Fleet + Infrastructure = 64), the northbound
       UNS door (Uns + Uns/Sparkplug + Site = 37), and the one taken. AL-1's selection rule —
       RECOVERABILITY, the surface whose sentences are fixed by an artefact already in this tree — was
       re-derived rather than inherited, and it is why the driver families were not taken despite being
       the largest remaining unit: AL-1 measured that surface as full of members with nothing to say
       beyond their names, and that is a FINDING somebody owes, not 109 sentences.

       WHAT WAS PAID: the canonical envelope and its whole journey, 62 warnings in TWELVE files.
       Transport/TransportCoordinator.cs 9, Models/Envelopes.cs 7, Mapping/MappingProfile.cs 7,
       Transport/AutoTransport.cs 6, Transport/DemoTransport.cs 5, Transport/LiveTransport.cs 5,
       Transport/SwitchableTransport.cs 5, Transport/ITransport.cs 4, Transport/WalFlushPump.cs 4,
       Models/Enums.cs 4, Mapping/Normalizer.cs 4, Mapping/MappingProfileResolver.cs 2. One type joins
       them — `CanonicalEnvelope` — and the boundary is checkable rather than argued: THREE DIRECTORIES
       TAKEN WHOLE (Transport/, Mapping/, Models/), each left at a residue of zero.

